  <description>Part of the Archinity suite.

Adds the Achonion Sanguophage xenotype and the "Seed of Archinity" scenario: a neolithic tribe carrying two archite-tainted immortals, and no idea what they are yet.

Requires Biotech. Genes are drawn from Biotech, Odyssey, Vanilla Quests Expanded - Ancients, and Vanilla Races Expanded - Sanguophage / Saurid / Waster. Missing sources degrade gracefully - the xenotype simply loses those genes.</description>
